      "date": "2026-02-16T07:51:19.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.25 (vs ₹0.99 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.25 (up from ₹0.99 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹222.4m (up 3.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹21.7m (up 27% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.8% (up from 8.0% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 34% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 4% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
